---@field senderLocalPart? string Local part of From address
---@field replyTo? string Reply-to address
---@field senderDisplayName? string Sender display name
---@field customized? boolean Output only. Whether the body or subject of the email is customized.

---@alias gcp.unstable.identitytoolkit_v2.GoogleCloudIdentitytoolkitAdminV2EmailTemplateBodyFormatEnum "BODY_FORMAT_UNSPECIFIED"|"PLAIN_TEXT"|"HTML"

