---The reCAPTCHA Enterprise integration config.
---@class gcp.unstable.identitytoolkit_v2.GoogleCloudIdentitytoolkitAdminV2RecaptchaConfig
---@field phoneEnforcementState? gcp.unstable.identitytoolkit_v2.GoogleCloudIdentitytoolkitAdminV2RecaptchaConfigPhoneEnforcementStateEnum|string The reCAPTCHA config for phone provider, containing the enforcement status. The phone provider contains all SMS related user flows protected by reCAPTCHA.
